ese definitions more about that will  be said in the remainder of this unit  and our next lecture we'll pick up the  game of mathematics in a different  context but until next time goodbye  funding for the publication of this  video was provided by the Gabriella and  Paul Rosenbaum foundation  help ocw continue to provide free and  open access to MIT courses by making a  donation at ocw.mit.edu/donate

